        "14,000+ happy repeat orders",
        "Real reviews from real UK customers, collected on our order confirmation emails.",
        "\"Ordered on a Tuesday afternoon and it was on my doorstep Thursday morning. Genuinely didn't expect UK shipping to be this fast for Korean skincare.\"",
        "\"The Beauty of Joseon sun cream sold me on this site, but the packaging and speed are what've kept me coming back every month since.\"",
